data: {"id": "3a5e37de8e4747df-thinking-parallel_evidence-1287", "run_id": "3a5e37de8e4747df", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已获取关键证据。让我总结已采集的事实：\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 生命周期（Metrics + kubectl_describe + YAML）**\n   - 状态：`Pending`，phase = `Pending`，ContainerCreating（waiting reason = \"ContainerCreating\"）\n   - 节点：`node2` (10.2.0.50)\n   - Pod UID：`546ed0f3-c379-4bda-a2fe-3ffbf1b916a2`\n   - 容器 `app`：image = `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`，imagePullPolicy = IfNotPresent，无 imagePullSecrets\n   - restarts = 0，未启动过\n\n2. **根本原因（kubectl_describe Events）**\n   - **Event: `NoNetworkFound`** from multus（重复25分钟），明确提示 `", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789059140581, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

