data: {"id": "3a5e37de8e4747df-final", "run_id": "3a5e37de8e4747df", "seq": 1292, "ts_ms": 1789059158000, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` | ContainerCreating | Pod 通过 annotation k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks 声明了网络依赖 'unavailable-network'，但 namespace aiops-case-05 中不存在对应的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 资源，导致 Multus CNI 插件无法找到网络配置，进而使 kubelet 在创建 Pod Sandbox 时失败。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `ContainerCreating` (container `app`) | 确认目标容器 `app` 处于等待状态，未进入运行阶段 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubelet | `Failed to create pod sandbox: ... failed to setup network for sandbox ... plugin type=\"multus\" ... failed (add)` | 指出 `kubelet` 在尝试创建 Pod Sandbox 时，因网络插件 `multus` 执行失败而回滚 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | multus | `cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found` | 明确失败原因：Multus 插件在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中查找名为 `unavailable-network` 的网络定义资源时返回 404 未找到 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1 (`ContainerCreating`) | 量化证实容器因上述原因长时间处于等待状态 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\n证据 2 与证据 3 共同构成了完整的因果链条：证据 2 展示了 `kubelet` 调用 `multus` 插件失败的宏观结果，而证据 3 精确指出了 `multus` 失败的具体原因是“找不到名为 `unavailable-network` 的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition”。证据 1 的状态与证据 4 的监控指标相互印证，表明该配置缺失是一个持续存在的阻断性故障。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n未声明 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 资源 (unavailable-network) → Multus 插件查找失败 (not found) → 网络配置初始化阻塞 → Pod Sandbox 创建回滚 → 容器处于 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **配置引用缺失**。\nPod 的 annotation `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks` 声明依赖名为 `unavailable-network` 的网络，但该依赖对应的 Kubernetes 自定义资源 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在（见证据 #3）。这导致 CNI 插件 Multus 无法注入网络环境，进而致使 `kubelet` 无法完成 Sandbox 创建，最终 Pod 长期停留在 `ContainerCreating` 状态（见证据 #1, #2）。\n\n未知因素：该 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 资源是配置遗漏、拼写错误导致，还是已被意外删除，当前证据不足以区分。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 27.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 39.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh: 39.6s (Evidence 31.6s, RCA 7.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh**: pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 76.599, "metrics": {"run_id": "3a5e37de8e4747df", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 76.60034775733948, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 76600.34775733948, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 66998.82006645203, "tool_calls": 11, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 11, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 26636.75022125244, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 9153.615713119507}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 27620.645761489868, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 39649.96910095215, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 9308.058738708496, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

